  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Miao Ming Shen asks him to present the expedition alliance agreement before the blue dragon whale trip. He steps forward among the eight invited immortals and places the agreement’s information into their minds at once, showing his information path methods.",
      "chapters": [
        1649
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_miao_ming_shen"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He wears a white robe and has a skinny face with convex cheekbones and deep eye bags. Bright light shines in his eyes.",
      "chapters": [
        1649
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Miao Ming Shen treats his information path attainment as impressive and uses the agreement display to read the group’s reactions. After small revisions, the immortals sign through Zeng Luo Zi’s methods. Before entering an undercurrent, Miao Ming Shen has him mark everyone with an information path immortal killer move so they can sense each other’s locations. Zeng Luo Zi applies the move with no offensive capability stated, and the group can then sense one another. On the beast-filled approach he fights behind Miao Ming Shen with Tong Hua.",
      "chapters": [
        1650
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "alliance-and-marking",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_tong_hua"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "At the Merit Obelisk he notes the three-hundred-day limit and that the ten differing missions mean competition. He later chooses a water monster extermination mission first, taking what looks like a harder, higher-merit task.",
      "chapters": [
        1651
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "merit-obelisk-missions",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "house_merit_obelisk"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "His information path methods cannot read the rank eight Immortal Gu House, so mission choice is left to judgment.",
      "chapters": [
        1652
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "merit-obelisk-missions",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_immortal_gu_house"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "During Shen Cong Sheng’s pursuit he moves like a white ghost in the sea and races Shen Qi in speed. An aerial sound blade slits his throat in the ensuing fight, and his head falls, but that death is later shown to be inside an illusion: he wakes on a beach with head attached.",
      "chapters": [
        1889
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "illusion-trial-survival",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_shen_cong_sheng",
        "char_shen_qi"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He remains with Miao Ming Shen’s group inside Dragon Whale Paradise and is named again as a rank seven information path Gu Immortal whose information path methods are restricted there.",
      "chapters": [
        1892
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "illusion-trial-survival",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_dragon_whale_paradise",
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Miao Ming Shen later invites him again when Fang Yuan recruits helpers for underwater formations, and recruiting him goes smoothly.",
      "chapters": [
        1903
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "illusion-trial-survival",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    }
  ],
